<title>UK: European base metals physical trades - March 5.</title>
<headline>European base metals physical trades - March 5.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>All prices in $/tonne (premium to LME unless stated).</p>
<p>MARCH 5 -</p>
<p>Western aluminium ingots, (duty-paid), Rotterdam, $130.</p>
<p>Russian A7E aluminium ingots, cif Rotterdam, $38.</p>
<p>Russian A7E aluminium ingots, cif Liverpool, $5.</p>
<p>MARCH 4 -</p>
<p>Ukrainian magnesium, cif Rotterdam, $2,350 (outright).</p>
<p>Russian cobalt, cif Rotterdam $18.00/lb (outright).</p>
<p>High grade cobalt, cif Rotterdam, $20.50/lb  (outright).</p>
<p>Cadmium 99.95 pct, cif Rotterdam, $0.75, $0.80/lb. (outright).</p>
<p>MARCH 3 -</p>
<p>Western aluminium ingots, cif Rotterdam, $48, $50.</p>
<p>Russian A7E aluminium ingots, cif Rotterdam $38.</p>
<p>FEB 27 -</p>
<p>Chinese tin, cif Rotterdam $20, $30.</p>
<p>Malaysian tin, cif Rotterdam, $15.</p>
<p>Indium, cif Rotterdam, $245, $255, $265 (outright).</p>
<p>Antimony, cif Rotterdam, $2,385 (outright).</p>
<p>Russian cobalt, cif Rotterdam, $17.85/lb (outright).</p>
<p>FEB 26 -</p>
<p>Russian A7E aluminium ingots, cif Rotterdam, $40.</p>
<p>Russian A6 aluminium ingot, cif Rotterdam, $25.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom 44 171 542 8080</p>
</text>
